          "chapter": 17,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "The cities of Aroer are forsaken. They will be for flocks, which shall lie down, and no one shall make them afraid.",
      "ko": "아로엘의 성읍들이 버림을 당하리니 양 무리를 치는 곳이 되어 양이 눕되 놀라게 할 자가 없을 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "460701f02857628f0a6d62aaeda69e4801daa65b5667880a98bc556c6866fb25",
      "translation_text_hash": "29335600a65cfa2ba57825aa624d92d92e788577d4de4cab1d254d588a998cf6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
